{"id":"4b65b240558a9358","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-hurewicz-map.md","title":"Hurewicz Map","display":"df-hurewicz-map — Hurewicz Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hurewicz-map","aliases":["58-df-hurewicz-map","Hurewicz Map"],"display":"df-hurewicz-map — Hurewicz Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-homology]]","[[58-df-homotopy-group]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hurewicz-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hurewicz-map</span><span>Hurewicz Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hurewicz-map — Hurewicz Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"58-df-homology\">58-df-homology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c682c089b3ac3182\" href=\"?note=c682c089b3ac3182\" title=\"58-df-homotopy-group\">58-df-homotopy-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (pointed topological space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in X\">\\(x_0\\in X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n(X,x_0)\">\\(\\pi_n(X,x_0)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n(X;\\mathbb Z)\">\\(H_n(X;\\mathbb Z)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_n: \\pi_n(X,x_0) \\to H_n(X;\\mathbb Z)\">\\(h_n: \\pi_n(X,x_0) \\to H_n(X;\\mathbb Z)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\pi_n(X,x_0)\">\\(c\\in\\pi_n(X,x_0)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in c\">\\(f\\in c\\)</span> (a pointed homotopy class and a representative)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n\">\\(\\iota_n\\)</span> (fundamental class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n\">\\(S^n\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (typing predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hurewicz\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S(h_n,X,\\tau_X,x_0,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h_n,\\pi_n(X,x_0),H_n(X;\\mathbb Z))\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\pi_n(X,x_0)\\;\\forall f\\in c\\;\\bigl(h_n(c)=f_*(\\iota_n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hurewicz\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S(h_n,X,\\tau_X,x_0,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h_n,\\pi_n(X,x_0),H_n(X;\\mathbb Z))\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\pi_n(X,x_0)\\;\\forall f\\in c\\;\\bigl(h_n(c)=f_*(\\iota_n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hurewicz map: convert homotopy class to homology class; natural transformation</li>\n<li>The topology is a public argument of the relation; two different topologies on the same carrier no longer collapse to the same Hurewicz-map assertion.</li>\n<li>The connectivity isomorphism and the degree-one abelianization statement are Hurewicz theorems, so they are not conjoined to the map definition.</li>\n<li>Higher: stable Hurewicz; relates stable homotopy to homology via <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{S}\">\\(\\mathbb{S}\\)</span>-algebra</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Whitehead, Elements of Homotopy Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-homology","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homotopy-group","status":"resolved","id":"c682c089b3ac3182","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homotopy-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"x_0\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_n(X,x_0)","display":false},{"tex":"H_n(X;\\mathbb Z)","display":false},{"tex":"h_n: \\pi_n(X,x_0) \\to H_n(X;\\mathbb Z)","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\pi_n(X,x_0)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in c","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_n","display":false},{"tex":"S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hurewicz\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S(h_n,X,\\tau_X,x_0,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h_n,\\pi_n(X,x_0),H_n(X;\\mathbb Z))\\land\n\\forall c\\in\\pi_n(X,x_0)\\;\\forall f\\in c\\;\\bigl(h_n(c)=f_*(\\iota_n)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{S}","display":false}],"bytes":1854,"backlinks":[{"id":"b83d63897d58e956","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HurewiczMap}_S(h_k,X,x_0,k)$ (see [[58-df-hurewicz-map]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-651","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-hurewicz-map.md|58-df-hurewicz-map]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["d9f6d19a1e737076","c682c089b3ac3182","36d7463d215be751","815e63e5071e7b58"]}